1103:
The purpose of this division pursuant to O.C.G.A. §§ 8-2-1 to 8-2-3 is to:
Impose water conservation restrictions;
Provide definitions;
Provide exemptions;
Provide for penalties;
Provide for related matters;
Repeal any conflicting ordinances;
Reduce water consumption from commercial car wash facilities by requiring all new conveyor car washes to install operational recycled water systems; and
For other purposes.
(Ord. No. OA-2015-06, 8-31-2015)
